batch_outputs:  [["\n\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of 604 and 863?\n\n# Reasoning:\n\nLet's calculate the product of 604 and 863 step by step.\n\n1. **Multiply 604 by 3 (ones place of 863):**\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 3 = 1,\\!812\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 604 by 60 (tens place of 863):**\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 60 = 604 \\times 6 \\times 10 = 3,\\!624 \\times 10 = 36,\\!240\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 604 by 800 (hundreds place of 863):**\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 800 = 604 \\times 8 \\times 100 = 4,\\!832 \\times 100 = 483,\\!200\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**\n   \\[\n   1,\\!812 + 36,\\!240 + 483,\\!200 = 521,\\!632\n   \\]\n\n# Answer:\nThe product of 604 and 863 is \\(\\boxed{521,\\!632}\\).", "521,632.\n\nFinally, I'll add all these partial products together: 1,812 plus 36,240 plus 483,200 equals 521,632.\n"]]
